 "conclusion": "E3 vs E0 on the test fold: confirmed precision 0.9458 -> 1.0 (delta +0.0542), at the cost of abstaining on 0.0388 of test pairs (266/6848); 75/75 E0 false positives (100.00%) are converted from confirmed merges into abstentions. Silver-label caveat: the identity_evidence obligation nearly reconstructs the positive/negative construction, so the precision gain is an upper bound tied to this labeling."
